grate those tests first, then use pytest for validation before applying the patch.","type":"summary_text"}],"type":"reasoning"}]}},"id":"a384acad-fb69-40d7-82ca-2b50602a89c2","timestamp":"2026-10-03T19:42:51.936Z","parentId":"85a9bcb5-b24e-4cb2-9ac6-1ad6df5984c3"}
